# Tutorial 05 - Transitions and Effects
@scenario {{SCENARIO_PREFIX}}_tutorial_05_transitions
@include {{CHARACTERS_INCLUDE}}
{{BG_DECL}}@label start
{{BG_START}}[inc tutorial_count]
[textspeed 28]
[autodelay 1650]
[show lavender center talking]
Lavender: Welcome to Tutorial 05 - Transitions and Effects.
Lavender: This lesson is intentionally long-form, so your team can use it as a living reference.
Lavender: We'll cover guided sections, a dense reference sheet, and a mini practice scene.
Lavender: Focus area for this file: Scene continuity through transitions and effects.
Lavender: Primary command family: [transition fade 450].
narrator: Keep this file editable. Teams usually annotate these lines with project-specific conventions.

@label lesson_menu
[show lavender far_left talking]
Lavender: Choose a section. You can revisit any section in any order.
> Guided section index -> section_index
> Dense reference sheet -> reference_sheet
> Practice scene -> practice_scene
> Return to Tutorial Hub -> return_hub

@label section_index
[show lavender far_left talking]
Lavender: Guided sections:
> Section 01 -> section_01
> Section 02 -> section_02
> Section 03 -> section_03
> Section 04 -> section_04
> Section 05 -> section_05
> Section 06 -> section_06
> Section 07 -> section_07
