@label section_01
[show lavender left talking]
Lavender: Section 01 for Scene continuity through transitions and effects.
Lavender: Intent: build a repeatable workflow, not one-off script tricks.
Lavender: Command anchor: [transition fade 450].
narrator: Example line A01: [transition crossfade 700 field_evening]
narrator: Example line B01: [screen flash 0.22 120 1 1 1]
Lavender: Read this as pattern language: setup, execute, validate, iterate.
Lavender: Tip 01: annotate why, not only what, in your own scripts.
Lavender: Team rule 01: keep naming and folder structures stable as assets grow.
Lavender: Review checkpoint 01: does this section still mirror runtime behavior?
